#: part/KWView.cpp:172
msgid "Shows and hides header display"
msgstr "Wiest oder verstickt de Koppansicht"

#: part/KWView.cpp:173
msgid ""
"Selecting this option toggles the display of headers in KWord.<br/><br/"
">Headers are special frames at the top of each page which can contain page "
"numbers or other information."
msgstr ""
"Dit maakt de Koppregen an oder ut.<br/><br/>Koppregen sünd besünner Rahmens "
"baven elk Siet, de Sietnummern oder anner Informatschonen bargen köönt."

#: part/KWView.cpp:178
msgid "Enable Document Footers"
msgstr "Dokment-Footregen anmaken"

#: part/KWView.cpp:180
msgid "Disable Document Footers"
msgstr "Dokment-Footregen utmaken"

#: part/KWView.cpp:181
msgid "Shows and hides footer display"
msgstr "Wiest oder verstickt de Footansicht"

#: part/KWView.cpp:182
msgid ""
"Selecting this option toggles the display of footers in KWord. <br/><br/"
">Footers are special frames at the bottom of each page which can contain "
"page numbers or other information."
msgstr ""
"Dit maakt de Footregen an oder ut.<br/><br/>Footregen sünd besünner Rahmens "
"nerrn elk Siet, de Sietnummern oder anner Informatschonen bargen köönt."

#: part/KWView.cpp:187
msgid "Snap to Grid"
msgstr "Backig Gadder"

#: part/KWView.cpp:192
msgid "Raise Frame"
msgstr "Rahmen na vörn"

#: part/KWView.cpp:195
msgid ""
"Raise the currently selected frame so that it appears above all the other "
"frames"
msgstr "Aktuell köört Rahmen heel na vörn halen"

#: part/KWView.cpp:197
msgid ""
"Raise the currently selected frame so that it appears above all the other "
"frames. This is only useful if frames overlap each other. If multiple frames "
"are selected they are all raised in turn."
msgstr ""
"Aktuell köört Rahmen heel na vörn halen. Dat bringt bloots wat, wenn Rahmens "
"överenanner liggt. Wenn mehr Rahmens köört sünd, warrt se achternanner "
"anornt."

#: part/KWView.cpp:202
msgid "Lower Frame"
msgstr "Rahmen na achtern"

#: part/KWView.cpp:205
msgid ""
"Lower the currently selected frame so that it disappears under any frame "
"that overlaps it"
msgstr "Aktuell köört Rahmen heel na achtern stellen"

#: part/KWView.cpp:207
msgid ""
"Lower the currently selected frame so that it disappears under any frame "
"that overlaps it. If multiple frames are selected they are all lowered in "
"turn."
msgstr ""
"Aktuell köört Rahmen heel na achtern stellen. Wenn mehr Rahmens köört sünd, "
"warrt se achternanner anornt."

#: part/KWView.cpp:211
msgid "Bring to Front"
msgstr "Na vörn halen"

#: part/KWView.cpp:215
msgid "Send to Back"
msgstr "Na achtern stellen"

#: part/KWView.cpp:219
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Variable"

