msgstr "Leesteken..."

#: part/KWView.cpp:229
msgid "Select Bookmark..."
msgstr "Leesteken kören..."

#: part/KWView.cpp:235
msgid "Frame Borders"
msgstr "Rahmenränners"

#: part/KWView.cpp:236
msgid "Turns the border display on and off"
msgstr "Rahmen an-/utmaken"

#: part/KWView.cpp:241
msgid ""
"Turns the border display on and off.<br/><br/>The borders are never printed. "
"This option is useful to see how the document will appear on the printed "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Rahmen an-/utmaken<br/><br/>De Ränners warrt nienich druckt. Dit lett sik as "
"Druckvöransicht bruken."

#: part/KWView.cpp:243
msgid "Page Layout..."
msgstr "Siet-Utsehn..."

#: part/KWView.cpp:245
msgid "Change properties of entire page"
msgstr "Egenschappen vun de hele Siet ännern"

#: part/KWView.cpp:246
msgid ""
"Change properties of the entire page.<p>Currently you can change paper size, "
"paper orientation, header and footer sizes, and column settings.</p>"
msgstr ""
"Egenschappen vun de hele Siet ännern.<p>Opstunns kannst Du de Papeergrött, -"
"utrichten, Kopp- un Footreeg-Grötten, un de Striepeninstellen ännern.</p>"

#: part/KWView.cpp:249
msgid "Make inline"
msgstr "Inbetten"

#: part/KWView.cpp:250
msgid "Convert current frame to an inline frame"
msgstr "Aktuell Rahmen na en inbett Rahmen ümwanneln."

#: part/KWView.cpp:251
msgid ""
"Convert the current frame to an inline frame.<br><br>Place the inline frame "
"within the text at the point nearest to the frames current position."
msgstr ""
"Aktuell Rahmen na en inbett Rahmen ümwanneln.<br><br>Den inbett Rahmen "
"binnen den Text neegst em sien aktuell Positschoon platzeren."

#: part/KWView.cpp:265
msgid "Sentence, word and letter counts for this document"
msgstr "Sätz-, Wöör- un Bookstaventeller för dit Dokment"

#: part/KWView.cpp:266
msgid ""
"Information on the number of letters, words, syllables and sentences for "
"this document.<p>Evaluates readability using the Flesch reading score.</p>"
msgstr ""
"Informatschonen över de Tall vun Bookstaven, Wöör, Sülven un Sätz binnen dit "
"Dokment.<p>Reekt de Leesborkeit na de \"Flesch-Beweerten\" ut.</p>"

#: part/KWView.cpp:269
msgid "Show Rulers"
msgstr "Linealen wiesen"

#: part/KWView.cpp:271
msgid "Shows or hides rulers"
msgstr "Wiest oder verstickt de Linealen"

#: part/KWView.cpp:272
msgid ""
"The rulers are the white measuring spaces top and left of the document. The "
"rulers show the position and width of pages and of frames and can be used to "
"position tabulators among others.<p>Uncheck this to disable the rulers from "
"being displayed.</p>"
msgstr ""
"De Linealen sünd de witt Maatafstänn baven un linkerhand dat Dokment. De "
"Linealen wiest de Positschoon un Breed vun Sieden un Rahmens un laat sik "
"för't Positschoneren vun Tabulatoren bruken.<p>Maak dit ut, wenn Du keen "
"Linealen wiesen wullt.</p>"

#: part/KWView.cpp:280
msgid "Delete Page"
msgstr "Siet wegdoon"

#: part/KWView.cpp:287
msgid "Formatting Characters"
msgstr "Formateren-Tekens"

#: part/KWView.cpp:291
msgid "Toggle the display of non-printing characters"
msgstr "Nich-druckbor Tekens wiesen/versteken"

#: part/KWView.cpp:292
msgid ""
"Toggle the display of non-printing characters.<br/><br/>When this is "
"enabled, KWord shows you tabs, spaces, carriage returns and other non-"
"printing characters."
msgstr ""
"Nich-druckbor Tekens wiesen/versteken.<br/><br/>Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt "
"Tabulatoren, Freetekens, WagenRetuurs un anner nich-druckbor Tekens wiest."

#: part/KWView.cpp:295
msgid "Select All Frames"
msgstr "All Rahmens kören"

#: part/KWView.cpp:300
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Wegdoon"

#: part/KWView.cpp:306
msgid "Show Grid"
msgstr "Gadder wiesen"

#: part/KWView.cpp:312 part/KWView.cpp:1076
msgid "Create Linked Copy"
msgstr "Verbunnen Kopie opstellen"

#: part/KWView.cpp:314
msgid "Create a copy of the current frame, always showing the same contents"
msgstr ""
"En Kopie vun den aktuellen Rahmen opstellen, de jümmers den sülven Inholt "
"wiest."

#: part/KWView.cpp:315
msgid ""
"Create a copy of the current frame, that remains linked to it. This means "
"they always show the same contents: modifying the contents in such a frame "
"will update all its linked copies."
msgstr ""
"En Kopie vun den aktuellen Rahmen opstellen, de mit em tokoppelt blifft. Dit "
"bedüüdt, dat se den sülven Inholt hebbt: Ännern vun solk en Rahmen sien "
"Inholt frischt all tohören Kopien op."

#: part/KWView.cpp:320
msgid "Create a custom vector outline that text will run around"
msgstr "Egen Vektorümreet för rundlopen Text opstellen"

#: part/KWView.cpp:321
msgid ""
"Text normally runs around the content of a shape, when you want a custom "
"outline that is independent of the content you can create one and alter it "
"with the vector tools"
msgstr ""
"Text löppt normalerwies rund den Inholt vun en Form. Wenn Du en egen Ümreet "
"bruukst, de nich vun den Inholt afhangt, kannst Du em opstellen un later mit "
"dat Vektorwarktüüch ännern."

